{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52306","headline":"诗（幷序） 六十七 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 六十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亡（张改作「妄」）随（项校「玉髓」）长年术，金刚不坏身。\n俱伤生死苦，谁兑（项校「免」）湼盘因。\n精魂归寂灭，骨肉化灰尘。\n释老由自气（戴校「犹自去」，项校「犹自弃」），何况迷遇（项校「愚」）人。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52306.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52306","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}